== Friendly Charger ==
{{infobox monster
 | dlc         = a
 | id          = 23
 | subtype     = 1
 | description = Slowly moves around the room, charging at enemies when they get in its line of sight.
 | base hp     = 20
 | behavior    = Charges at enemies when in its line of sight, dealing contact damage. Will always spawn friendly via {{I|My Shadow|n}}.
}}
The dark [[friendly]] chargers act like normal chargers and will charge at enemies when they have a chance. They will attack enemies until they run out of hp either from contact with enemies or hazards (e.g. [[spikes]] or {{e|Fire Place}}).

=== Notes ===
* The allied chargers are affected by mass slowdown effects from items such as the {{i|Stop Watch}}, granting the Shadow Chargers a disadvantage.
* {{dlc|nr}} If Isaac has [[homing tears]], they will home in on allied chargers.
* The allied chargers will take damage from any sort of explosion, {{dlc|a+}} except from your own general explosions, {{dlc|nr}} though certain synergies involving {{i|Scatter Bombs}} may kill the Friendly charger.
* {{dlc|ana+}} With {{i|Punching Bag}}, the allied chargers may attack the Punching Bag instead of enemies.
